  "notes": [
    "This calendar is for historical Standard metagame reconstruction, not card-by-card legality enforcement.",
    "PTCGL dates are exact official playability timestamps where available. During this period they are consistently 17:00 UTC on the Thursday before the normal physical release date.",
    "IRL dates are derived from the historical two-week tournament-legality rule unless an explicit exception exists.",
    "Mega Evolution—Ascended Heroes is the important exception in this period: official tournament legality was delayed to 2026-03-06.",
    "Functional reprints and isolated early-product card exceptions are intentionally ignored for archetype-level historical modelling unless later shown to materially affect a backtest window.",
    "Format labels such as BRS-SCR and TEF-PBL are display shorthand. Actual Standard legality is regulation-mark based, with legal reprints remaining legal regardless of the set printed on a specific copy."
